                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_0",
                  "html": "<div> <div> <div> <h1><span>Access statement for Blaco Hill Farm Cottages</span></h1> </div> </div> </div> <p>Our 7 self catering cottages have been converted from disused farm buildings, on a working arable farm. The cottages are set around a shared courtyard and carpark. We have tried to provide as much information as possible in this statement, if you have any queries please do call.</p> <p>We look forwarding to welcoming you.</p> <div> <div> <div> <p><span>We have a no smoking policy in all our cottages</span></p> </div> </div> </div>",
                  "sansHeadings": {},
                  "hiddenOn": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "divider",
                  "id": "et_pb_divider_0",
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
