          "columns": [
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_1",
                  "html": "<div> <div> <div> <h3><span>Pre-arrival</span></h3> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <ul> <li><span>We are 4* rated with Visit Britain</span><span><br> </span><span></span></li> <li><span>We are listed on booking.com &amp; groupaccommodation.com&nbsp;</span><span></span></li> <li><span>Bookings/enquiries can be made via email or phone. </span></li> <li><span>The nearest bus stop is at the bottom of the farm drive. </span></li> <li><span>The nearest train station is 5 miles away in Retford. </span></li> <li><span>We have wireless internet access</span></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>",
                  "sansHeadings": {},
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_2",
                  "html": "<h3><span>Arrival &amp; car parking facilities</span></h3> <ul> <li>A large car park is provided for use by all cottages, there is space for 4&nbsp;<span>vehicles to park under cover on a first come first use basis.</span></li> <li>Distance from each property to the car park varies.</li> <li>Car park and path surface is small pea gravel over tarmac or concrete base.</li> </ul>",
                  "sansHeadings": {},
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
