                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_4",
                  "html": "<ul> <li>Sleeps 5/6</li> <li>One step of 8cm from carpark &amp; door threshold of 6cm.</li> <li>Carpark 26metres</li> <li>Front door is 84cm wide</li> <li>A patio for sole use of property is accessed from front door, over gravel path or by French doors in lounge, 59/112cm , 3 steps down 15,13,10 cm over slabs to graveled area with table and seating for 6.</li> <li>Underfloor heating in the sitting room, radiators through rest of property.</li> <li>Hot water on demand</li> </ul>",
                  "sansHeadings": {},
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
